# argument                           |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .......................................................................................................
input                                |   string       |  mandatory  |   
output                               |   string       |  mandatory  |   
config                               |   string       |  mandatory  |   
nsteps                               |   integer      |  optional   |   30000
burn-in                              |   integer      |  optional   |   1000
fit-number                           |   integer      |  optional   |   0
proposal-step                        |   double       |  optional   |   0.3
mesg-thresholds                      |   string       |  optional   |   verbosity.xml
disable-adaptive,enable-adaptive     |   boolean_list |  optional   |   disable-adaptive
use-prefit-errors                    |   boolean      |  optional   |   use-postfit-errors
start-at-bestfit                     |   boolean      |  optional   |   start-at-thrown
write-expanded-tree                  |   boolean      |  optional   |   no-write-expanded-tree
pot-override                         |   double       |  optional   |   -999
nthreads                             |   integer      |  optional   |   -1

use-postfit-correlations,use-prefit-correlations,use-no-correlations|   boolean_list |  optional   |   use-postfit-correlations
